"

#### %s\n\n```{r simpleBadEval%s}
computeSomething()
plot(iris$Petal.Width, iris$Petal.Weight, main='%s')\n```

Finished %s
", titles, 1:5, titles, titles), collapse = '\n'))
```

Now write the results:

